# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dataset — NEVER commit
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MIVIA-IWDD-500 is ~500 videos and ships with NO licence; the
# maintainers list licensing as unresolved. Redistributing it via
# a git remote is both a size problem and a legal one.
DATASET/

# Video files anywhere else (stray copies, clips, exports).
# Need to commit a demo clip? git add -f path/to/clip.mp4
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pipeline artifacts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Feature cache: one .npz per video per VLM signature. Tens of GB
# after a full extraction run, and fully regenerable from DATASET.
artifacts/features/

# Raw generated captions (.jsonl, one per video). Large, and
# regenerable — keep locally for inspection, not in git.
artifacts/captions/

# Run logs.
artifacts/logs/

# Model checkpoints. The CNN+GRU one is only ~8 MB, but a full
# benchmark sweep writes one per fold per architecture.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx

# NOTE: small result files under artifacts/runs/ and
# artifacts/reports/ are deliberately NOT ignored — results.json,
# benchmark.json, benchmark.md and config.json are what make a run
# reproducible and reviewable. They are a few KB each.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.dmypy.json
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/

# Notebooks
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model / framework caches
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only matters if HF_HOME or TORCH_HOME is pointed inside the repo.
.cache/
hf_cache/
.huggingface/
*.lock

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets and credentials
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
kaggle.json
*.pem
*.key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
